     *
     * Then perform the ECC ops.
     *
     * U = add(T, U)
     * T = dbl(T)
     *
     * Which leaves you with state
     *
     * k[i] == 0: U = add(R, S), T = dbl(R)
     * k[i] == 1: U = add(S, R), T = dbl(S)
     *
     * Swapping T, U conditionally on k[i] leaves you with state
     *
